  "sentences": [
    {"text": "A fierce, unwavering determination burned inside her.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A calm, steady focus settled over him as he picked up the brush.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "A grim, steely resolve hardened in his chest.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "Quiet, stubborn persistence kept her at the desk long after the others had gone.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A relentless, driving ambition pushed him onwards.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "She steeled herself for the climb.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "He blocked out every distraction: the clock, the voices, the rain on the glass.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Tired as she was, she refused to give in.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "He gathered his courage and knocked.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "In that deep, patient concentration, the whole world narrowed to a single point.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "A dogged, single-minded effort drove her through the final mile.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "He vowed to finish what he had begun.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A small, nagging doubt rose in her mind, and she pushed it aside.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "Sheer, iron willpower held him to his task.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "In an absorbed, contented silence, she lost track of time.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "A cold, unflinching purpose stiffened his spine.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "Her bright, eager confidence grew with every success.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "She concentrated so hard that she did not hear her name.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "He persevered, one line at a time, until the page was full.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "She resolved never to be beaten by that hill again.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "He braced himself for the challenge and ignored the ache in his arms.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Her attention sharpened, and her purpose strengthened.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Nothing would stop her now; she would have walked through a wall.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "His tenacity was almost frightening; he fought for every inch.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "For a moment his resolve wavered, and the goal seemed impossibly far away.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "Determination can be lonely; nobody else stayed up to see her finish.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "There was something merciless in his discipline.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "With patience and perseverance, the knot came loose at last.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "\"I can do this,\" she told herself, and for the first time she believed it.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "It took conviction to begin and perseverance to end.", "vibe": "General"}
  ]
